        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml seq_cancel_appointment\ntitle Tuần Tự (Sequence Diagram) - Hủy Lịch Hẹn\n\nactor \&quot;Bệnh nhân\&quot; as BN\nparticipant \&quot;:HuyLichUI\&quot; as UI\nparticipant \&quot;:AppointmentService\&quot; as AptSvc\ndatabase \&quot;:CSDL\&quot; as DB\nparticipant \&quot;:SMSService\&quot; as SMS\n\nBN -&gt; UI: 1. Bam yeu cau huy lich (appointmentId, lyDo)\nactivate UI\n\nUI -&gt; AptSvc: 2. cancelAppointment(appointmentId, reason)\nactivate AptSvc\n\nAptSvc -&gt; DB: 3. SELECT status FROM Appointment WHERE id = appointmentId\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; AptSvc: 4. Tra ve status\ndeactivate DB\n\nalt status == &#39;ChoXacNhan&#39; || status == &#39;DaXacNhan&#39;\n  AptSvc -&gt; DB: 5. UPDATE Appointment SET status = &#39;DaHuy&#39;\n  activate DB\n  DB --&gt; AptSvc: 6. CSDL cap nhat thanh cong\n  deactivate DB\n  \n  AptSvc -&gt;&gt; SMS: 7. sendNotice(dentistPhone, \&quot;Lich hen da bi huy\&quot;) [Async Message]\n  \n  AptSvc --&gt; UI: 8. Huy lich hen thanh cong\n  UI --&gt; BN: 9. Thong bao: \&quot;Lich hen da duoc huy thanh cong\&quot;\nelse status == &#39;DaKham&#39;\n  AptSvc --&gt; UI: 10. Loi: \&quot;Khong the huy cuoc hen da hoan thanh\&quot;\n  UI --&gt; BN: 11. Hien thi canh bao loi\nend\n\ndeactivate AptSvc\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="I12sn7LnhGPiePR9djo5-377">
